@host = http://localhost:8080

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "max@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery"
}

### Login (legt Session-Cookie an, wird automatisch weitergereicht)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "max@example.com",
  "password": "correct horse battery"
}

### Me
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### Login mit falschem Passwort -> 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "max@example.com",
  "password": "falsch aber lang"
}

### Register mit ungültigen Feldern -> 422 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "keine-mail",
  "password": "kurz"
}